Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:36:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: leds: backlight: Describe the LED driver behind
 Apple DWI

On the iPad 5 the DWI brightness commands reach a TI LP8559, which has an
enable of its own on I2C: a DWI brightness of 0 leaves its LEDs lit at the
lowest current, and only its command register turns them off (iOS does so
through the ADT /backlight function-backlight_enable). Let the DWI node
name that LED driver, and add the LP8559 to the LP855x family binding.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/apple,dwi-bl.yaml  | 8 ++++++++
 .../bindings/leds/backlight/lp855x-backlight.yaml         | 1 +
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/apple,dwi-bl.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/apple,dwi-bl.yaml
index 29caeb3..af1be17 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/apple,dwi-bl.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/apple,dwi-bl.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,14 @@ properties:
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  apple,led-driver:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description:
+      The LED driver that receives the DWI brightness commands, when it has
+      an enable of its own on another bus. A DWI brightness of 0 leaves its
+      LEDs lit at their lowest current; they are only off while it is
+      disabled (iPad 5: TI LP8559 on I2C).
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/lp855x-backlight.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/lp855x-backlight.yaml
index 9416e1b..bf294d5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/lp855x-backlight.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/lp855x-backlight.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ properties:
       - ti,lp8555
       - ti,lp8556
       - ti,lp8557
+      - ti,lp8559
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
